meta {
  name: Course progress - Get
  type: http
  seq: 124
}

get {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/communities/nswswk8w8wso0ko8owwk8k0w/spaces/q8kcoursespacestarthere1/progress
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  Your progress in a course space (#1304, ADR 0034): total, completed, completed_lessons (cuids) and next_lesson (the first lesson that is not done, null when all are). Members of the community only (403 for an outsider of a public course). A space that is not a course gives a 422.
}
